丞相軍諮祭酒，轉琅邪國中尉。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-yutan:line097:m0017"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-w076r-fan0:a","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-yutan:line097","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"騎都尉","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-yutan:line097:m0017","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本來源官稱或所任，未受另記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-076-yutan:line097","text":"虞潭，字思奧，會稽餘姚人，吳騎都尉翻之孫也。父忠，仕至宜都太守。吳之亡也，堅壁不降，遂死之。潭清貞有檢操，州辟從事、主簿，舉秀才，大司馬、齊王冏請為祭酒，除祁鄉令，徙醴陵令。值張昌作亂，郡縣多從之，潭獨起兵斬昌別率鄧穆等。襄陽太守華恢上潭領建平太守，以疾固辭。遂周旋征討，以軍功賜爵都亭侯。陳敏反，潭東下討敏弟贊于江州。廣州刺史王矩上潭領廬陵太守。綏撫荒餘，咸得其所。又與諸軍共平陳恢，仍轉南康太守，進爵東鄉侯。尋被元帝檄，使討江州刺史華軼。潭至廬陵，會軼已平，而湘川賊杜弢猶盛。江州刺史衛展上潭並領安成太守。時甘卓屯宜陽，為杜弢所逼。潭進軍救卓，卓上潭領長沙太守，固辭不就。王敦版潭為湘東太守，復以疾辭。弢平後，元帝召補丞相軍諮祭酒，轉琅邪國中尉。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-076-yutan:line097:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"虞潭","kind":"person","person_id":"9v9_cj5_dor","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-yutan:line097:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"思奧","kind":"person","person_id":"9v9_cj5_dor","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-yutan:line097:m0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"翻","kind":"person","person_id":"izi_e36_p1g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-yutan:line097:m0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"忠","kind":"person","person_id":"izi_e36_p1g_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-yutan:line097:m004